# Build context = src/ (compose `build.context: ../src`). The Dockerfile copies only the
# compile inputs, so the context is a whitelist of exactly those: everything else
# (tests, local Rider build artifacts) stays on the host and never reaches the daemon.
# Config plane, bridge, secrets and runtime state live outside src/ entirely.
*
!global.json
!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Packages.props
!PiAgent.slnx
!Platform/
!Platform/**
!Infrastructure/
!Infrastructure/**
!Migrator/
!Migrator/**
!Hosts/
!Hosts/**
# build artifacts of local Rider/CLI builds inside the source tree
**/bin/
**/obj/
